{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06772","headline":"灞上闲居 · 王昌龄","name":"灞上闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿都有归客，偃卧滋阳村。\n轩冕无枉顾，清川照我门。\n空林网夕阳，寒鸟赴荒园。\n廓落时得意，怀哉莫与言。\n庭前有孤鹤，欲啄常翩翻。\n爲我衔素书，吊彼颜与原。\n二君既不朽，所以慰其魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}